{"id":"1039d90e5cc4edb6","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system.md","title":"多项式填充的证明系统","display":"df-polynomially-padded-proof-system — 多项式填充的证明系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system","aliases":["72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system"],"display":"df-polynomially-padded-proof-system — 多项式填充的证明系统","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §§2.2–2.4 print550–552/PDF562–564; local coding-dependence example","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomially-padded-proof-system — 多项式填充的证明系统"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §§2.2–2.4 print550–552/PDF562–564; local coding-dependence example"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>P为 Cook–Reckhow 系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>，τ₀为固定重言式编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,u\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(w,u\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^m\">\\(1^m\\)</span> 是 m 个1的串；拼接处的0是分隔位。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pad}_k(w):=1^{|w|^k}\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown w.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pad}_k(w):=1^{|w|^k}\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown w.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P^{\\langle k\\rangle}(u):=\\begin{cases}\nP(w),&amp;u=\\operatorname{pad}_k(w),\\\\\n\\tau_0,&amp;u\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pad}_k).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P^{\\langle k\\rangle}(u):=\\begin{cases}\nP(w),&amp;u=\\operatorname{pad}_k(w),\\\\\n\\tau_0,&amp;u\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pad}_k).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>首个0唯一分隔前缀与 w，再核对前缀长度等于 |w|ᵏ，故解析唯一且多项式时间。固定 k 是系统参数，不能在运行时任意增长；非法输入仍输出指定重言式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"w,u\\in\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"1^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pad}_k(w):=1^{|w|^k}\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown w.","display":true},{"tex":"P^{\\langle k\\rangle}(u):=\\begin{cases}\nP(w),&u=\\operatorname{pad}_k(w),\\\\\n\\tau_0,&u\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pad}_k).\n\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1443,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-s